 the map, unlock restricted areas, and figure out what secrets lie just beyond your reach.   Key Features:Arm-Based Locomotion: Master the intuitive, physics-driven movement system without relying on thumbsticks.Chilling Atmosphere: Unique maps filled with eerie areas, mysterious riddles, and built-in suspense.   Keypad & Door Puzzles: Hunt for hidden codes scattered around the environment to open sealed doors and passages.   Social Multiplayer: Hang out with friends, join room codes, and explore together.   Regular Updates: Enjoy new cosmetics, map tweaks, and fresh content added over time!", "short_description": "Spooky Pavians is an atmospheric VR horror fangame with physics-based, arm-driven locomotion! Explore dark locations, search for keypad codes, unlock secrets, and experience pure suspense with your friends."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ywp6aPeDjZl0VxxPfylyjPmAhXCc8RPKZt2GGTht57I/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Spooky Games Poland", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/tospookygames/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "1426313050561214"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1127591883134084"}]}, "baseline_offer